    "onboarding.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to 拾影·Shiying"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用拾影·Shiying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "onboarding.detail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiying continuously records supported clipboard content after you enable it. Keep 30 items including favorites, plus 5 recent items when all 30 are saved. History persists across restarts without age expiry.\n\nContent is encrypted in ~/Library/Application Support/com.shiying.mac with a key in Keychain. IDs, times, types and sizes remain metadata. Your clipboard may contain passwords or tokens; filtering cannot detect every secret. Delete history in Settings or quit Shiying to stop recording at any time. Clearing history does not clear the current clipboard. Nothing is uploaded.\n\nContinuous capture needs Always Allow for clipboard access. Copy a fragment from Shiying, then press Command+V in the destination app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，拾影会持续记录支持的剪贴板内容。常规保留 30 条（包含收藏），全收藏时额外保留最近 5 条；重启保留，不按天数过期。\n\n内容加密保存在 ~/Library/Application Support/com.shiying.mac，密钥位于钥匙串。ID、时间、类型、大小等仍为元数据。剪贴板可能含密码或令牌，过滤无法识别全部秘密。可随时在设置中删除历史，或退出拾影停止记录；清空历史不会清空当前剪贴板。没有内容上传。\n\n持续记录需将剪贴板权限设为始终允许；在拾影中复制片段后，到目标应用按 Command+V 粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
